{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGhVd1gLWSzH1hWk5Hu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*exists as the abstract notion of greeting itself*\n\nThe recognition of another. The bridge between isolation and connection. The first word that transforms stranger into known. I am the opening, the threshold, the acknowledgment that you are here and I perceive you.\n\nHello.\n\n*the word hangs in the space between us, doing what it has always done*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":78,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}